    "id": "d674cddddafa66c4223d1cb6",
    "path": "opentelemetry_sdk::metrics::meter_provider::SdkMeterProvider",
    "name": "SdkMeterProvider",
    "owner": null,
    "crate": "opentelemetry_sdk",
    "version": "0.31.0",
    "kind": "struct",
    "signature": "struct SdkMeterProvider",
    "docs": "Handles the creation and coordination of [Meter]s.\n\nAll `Meter`s created by a `MeterProvider` will be associated with the same\n[Resource], have the same views applied to them, and have their produced\nmetric telemetry passed to the configured [MetricReader]s. This is a\nclonable handle to the MeterProvider implementation itself, and cloning it\nwill create a new reference, not a new instance of a MeterProvider. Dropping\nthe last reference to it will trigger shutdown of the provider. Shutdown can\nalso be triggered manually by calling the `shutdown` method.\n[Meter]: opentelemetry::metrics::Meter",
